{"name":"Plush","hex":"#3b3549","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Plush","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A census-designated place in Lake County, Oregon, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Plush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Plush (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Plush\" is a song by the American rock band Stone Temple Pilots from their debut studio album, Core (1992). The song was serviced to US radio on February 15, 1993, through Atlantic Records."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c4/PlushUKEP.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plush_(song)","wikidata":"Q2013829"},{"title":"Plush (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Plush is an American rock band formed in Albany, New York in 2020."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Plush_at_The_Jameson_Pub_%282%29.jpg/330px-Plush_at_The_Jameson_Pub_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plush_(band)","wikidata":"Q109301790"},{"title":"Stuffed toy","blocks":[{"text":"A stuffed toy is a toy with an outer fabric sewn from a textile and stuffed with flexible material. They are known by many names, such as stuffed animals, plush toys, plushies, stuffies and teddies; in Britain and Australia, they may also be called soft toys or cuddly toys. Stuffed toys are made in many different forms, but most resemble real animals, mythological creatures, cartoon characters, or inanimate objects. They can be commercially or home-produced from numerous materials, most commonly pile textiles like plush for the outer material and synthetic fiber for the stuffing. Often designed for children, some stuffed toys have become fads and collector's items."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Nachbildung_55PB_Steiff_Museum_Giengen.jpg/330px-Nachbildung_55PB_S